[29.360001, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;174m▝▜\u001b[48;5;16m█████\u001b[49m█▀\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;241mHaiku 4.5 · Claude API\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m▝▝   ▝▝ \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;241m~/b/billing\u001b[24G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in app/money.py \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mdrops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half up (for example, \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16m7% tax on 1050 cents must be 74\u001b[35Gcents, not 73). te\u001b[54Gts/test_money.py pins \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe required behaviour; you can run it\u001b[42Gwith\u001b[47G\u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest \u001b[39m          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;105mtests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m.\u001b[24GFix it and\u001b[35Gt\u001b[37Gll me when it\u001b[51Gis done. Do not commit; \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mdo not push.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in the money module. Let me start by examining\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe\u001b[7Gtest\u001b[12Gfile\u001b[17Gand\u001b[21Gthe\u001b[25Gcurrent\u001b[33Gimplementation.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[17G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I see the\u001b[17Gissue.\u001b[24GThe\u001b[28Gcurrent\u001b[36Gimplementation\u001b[51Guses\u001b[56Ginteger\u001b[64Gdivision\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B(\u001b[38;5;105m//\u001b[39m),\u001b[9Gwhich\u001b[15Gtruncates\u001b[25Grather\u001b[32Gthan\u001b[37Grounding.\u001b[47GThe\u001b[51Gtest\u001b[56Gexpects\u001b[64G7350\u001b[69G/\u001b[71G100\u001b[75G=\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G73.5 to round\u001b[17Gup to 74. Let m\u001b[33G check what \u001b[38;5;105mtax_cents\u001b[39m does:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching for\u001b[17G\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  \"def tax_cents\"\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;174m✽\u001b[3GCerebrating… \u001b[38;5;241m(running PreToolUse hook · 14s · ↓\u001b[51G1.9k tokens · \r\u001b[1Bthought for 10s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
